    {
      "track_id": "zh-CN-mandarin",
      "code": "zh-CN",
      "language": "汉语",
      "variant": "普通话",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "自己查字典",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "“自然”的近义词，“一定”好像不太准！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "它是“当然”“理应”“固然”。写“一定”可能就不对了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你不说“一定”吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你要学会查字典了！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "字典上有吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这个要你自己理解。别人说的不一定对。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "老师为什么叫你查字典？你的《新华字典》还是有用的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "大的《新华字典》吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_008_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:009",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "大的叫《现代汉语词典》。高中就是用这个。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_009_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "009",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "es-ES-elevenlabs",
      "code": "es-ES",
      "language": "西班牙语",
      "variant": "西班牙本土西语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Búscalo tú mismo en el diccionario",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_title_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:18+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Creo que «yiding» (sin duda) no es un sinónimo muy exacto de «ziran» (naturalmente).",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_001_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:20+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Los sinónimos son «dangran» (por supuesto), «liying» (como corresponde) y «guran» (ciertamente). Es posible que «yiding» (sin duda) sea incorrecto.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:24+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Pero no dijiste que era «yiding» (sin duda)?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:26+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¡Tienes que aprender a consultar el diccionario!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_004_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:28+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Eso aparece en el diccionario?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_005_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:29+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Tienes que entenderlo por ti mismo. Lo que dicen los demás no siempre es correcto.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_006_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:31+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Por qué crees que tu profesor te pide que consultes el diccionario? Tu *Diccionario Xinhua* sí que sirve.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_007_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:34+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Te refieres al *Diccionario Xinhua* grande?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_008_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:35+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:009",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "El grande se llama *Diccionario del chino contemporáneo*. Ese es el que usarás en el instituto.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_009_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:48:38+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
