    {
      "track_id": "fr-FR-elevenlabs",
      "code": "fr-FR",
      "language": "法语",
      "variant": "法国法语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Cherche toi-même dans le dictionnaire",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:49:53+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Je ne pense pas que « yiding » (certainement) soit vraiment un bon synonyme de « ziran » (naturellement) !",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:49:56+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Les synonymes sont « dangran » (bien sûr), « liying » (comme il se doit) et « guran » (certes). Écrire « yiding » (certainement) est peut-être incorrect.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-07-look-it-up-yourself_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:50:00+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
